flowchart LR
  browser([Browser]) -->|UI: HTTP :8080| web
  client([API clients]) -->|API: HTTP :8888| api
  subgraph host [Server: Docker Compose, restart unless-stopped, log rotation]
    web[web<br/>nginx: React SPA + /api proxy<br/>CSP, security headers, login rate limit]
    api[api<br/>FastAPI + uvicorn, 2 workers<br/>recovery engine, risk, agent, rewards, crew]
    migrate[migrate<br/>one-shot: alembic upgrade head]
    ingest[ingest<br/>one-shot: extracts → typed Parquet,<br/>trains delay + reward models]
    xdb[extracts-db<br/>one-shot: Parquet → PostgreSQL<br/>extracts schema]
    db[(PostgreSQL 18<br/>scenarios, decisions, audit,<br/>agent runs, extracts schema)]
    ops[(ops-data volume<br/>Parquet read by DuckDB,<br/>saved models, risk tables)]
    test[(test-data volume<br/>evaluator uploads)]
    input[/input extracts<br/>read-only mount/]
  end
  web -->|/api/| api
  api -->|SQLAlchemy| db
  api -->|DuckDB, read-only| ops
  api -->|read / write| test
  input --> ingest
  ingest --> ops
  ops --> xdb
  xdb --> db
  migrate --> db
  api -->|HTTPS| claude[Claude API]
